    "detailed_description": "This is a single shooter game, there is a first-person perspective and third-person perspective. <br />\r\nYou will play a soldier from a laboratory on a rescue mission in a city full of mutants. And find out why the whole story is true.<br />\r\nIn July 2025, a serious nuclear leak occurred in JH city, and the government ordered the quarantine of the area.<br />\r\nIn September 2025, you are sent to JH City on Mission 29 to investigate and rescue a doctor from the UPC, but the residents there have undergone some kind of mutation and become insane.<br />\r\nDamaged buildings, scattered army equipment, and what seems to be hiding in the darkness.<br />\r\nYou look at the smoke-filled nuclear power plant in the distance, and it doesn't seem so simple. Who's lying?",
